{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_title", "source_sha256": "1a8a091444e659d1dc596e8ba5850f6b8dd21f0443bb8bdfd5ebdaca870be933", "ja": "鳥籠を抱いたまま", "zh": "拥抱着鸟笼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e925768cab54a21aacfd26d2164678b533fa7bf1a1f358709ae00ea0290cc4dc", "ja": "イベントに公演にと大忙しの朋花。そんな中\nプロデューサーが過労で倒れてしまう。公演\nを延期すると言う朋花と、それはできないと\n言うプロデューサー。譲らないふたりは互い\nに『誓い』を交わし、公演に臨むのだった。", "zh": "朋花忙于活动与公演，连轴转个不停。就在这时，\n制作人却因积劳成疾而倒下了。朋花提出要将公演\n延期，制作人却表示绝不能这么做。互不相让的两人\n向彼此许下了“誓言”，一同迎来了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bce0bdcc43ae9f425e8f979e29b346f41d340199d98f28e03c7691fa06eeb78c", "ja": "（朋花が歌い終わると、客席からは、\n割れんばかりの拍手と歓声が巻き起こった……）", "zh": "（朋花唱完歌后，观众席上响起了震耳欲聋的掌声和欢呼声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "7136702e3ddcdefb2a6ee046f0375f070a0b3c8c0a0f3569d926b0bcd52dab85", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたち～？\n聖母のステージは、楽しんでいただけましたか～？", "zh": "小猪崽们～？\n圣母的舞台，大家享受得还尽兴吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "a4847e932145010396f850c3b81ec675db9c95af5ce2692ee5368c184232e8d2", "ja": "ワアアァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "86f79bb8753335684a4a9c580cc18bf7ea36b4a717a139d2432fe7b7bf35d3b3", "ja": "ふふっ♪　よいお返事です～。これからも\nみなさんに、愛を注いでいきますから～……。", "zh": "呵呵♪回答得很好～今后也会继续向大家倾注爱意～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "87cfb59ba65474db3c744d9b4590d9be7b8a948912eb8119949b6dd6c35d802b", "ja": "みなさんも、忠誠と信仰を、\n忘れないようにしてくださいね～♪", "zh": "大家也请不要忘记，\n献上你们的忠诚与信仰哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1005_p", "source_sha256": "706882ba5398809afd968c5c94e2adeb3680e98e9b56bf2b5cebf931a3f6591c", "ja": "朋花、みんなもお疲れさま。いいステージだったぞ！\n瞬きも忘れるくらい、見入ってたよ。", "zh": "朋花，大家辛苦了。演出得很棒！\n\n我看得太入神，连眨眼都忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "ab4e7491e342ad77e98edcc1a40c4f326cef3abcc0a4ef838e41aad8678aa392", "ja": "うふふ。これくらい、当然ですよ～？\n私たちが、力を合わせたのですから～。", "zh": "呵呵。做到这种程度是理所应当的哦～？\n毕竟这可是我们齐心协力的成果呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "d71614321cfeff37329e768745841e2f243facead23c746941921e82d5646598", "ja": "みなさん、本当にありがとうございました～。\nおかげで素敵なライブになりましたよ～♪", "zh": "非常感谢大家～。\n多亏了大家，才办成了一场绝妙的演出哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "f05bf4a24807878eaa9783062dabe0cd0318f89963f82bf41d24b5f77c57b06a", "ja": "そんな、こちらこそです。\n子豚さま方と一緒に、うっとりしてしまいました♪", "zh": "哪里，我才要谢谢大家呢。和各位小猪大人一起，我也陶醉其中了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "7ca61ab9a5049f8807c3e9ae18a97dc0822ca0a0800c36d12a20f9e36d4b1782", "ja": "私も学ぶものが多かったし。\nお客さんの盛り上げ方とか、すごく参考になったな。", "zh": "我也学到了很多。比如怎样调动观众的气氛，真的很有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "14047e99b22add2d52fcc4432e3c545c122b75d4b8ca93a0362abf252a08d882", "ja": "ミキも今度『子豚ちゃん』って呼び方、\n使ってみようかな？　なんだかカワイイね。あはっ☆", "zh": "美希下次也试试叫“‘小猪猪’”吧？感觉挺可爱的。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bbf55cd3802622ca769c06d6c7df337a443f74397c266e168898127a978c7faf", "ja": "でもさ、あのタイトなスケジュールで、よくこんな\nステージにできたよな～。アタシ達、サイコー！", "zh": "不过话说回来，那么紧的日程，居然还能做出这么棒的舞台～。我们太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "61ff35b2ba2edc3757588ba324dca3817b356280394064c932865be2652f153a", "ja": "ふふっ♪　あっ、そういえば……仕掛け人さま、\n足の具合は大丈夫なのですか？", "zh": "呵呵♪　啊，对了……制作人先生，您的脚没事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1013_p", "source_sha256": "23f120bf545272e954bd4567a896748fdce818e0d604ccd6ee73afdad9c102a5", "ja": "うん、もう大分よくなったよ。\nほらこの通り、体重をかけても大丈夫……。", "zh": "嗯，已经好很多了。\n你看，像这样把重心压上去也没……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1014_null", "source_sha256": "5753d09a2c986ddff21deafdb1bb84c7ff2c0146df0f8f16ebc53adeae9acae9", "ja": "…………ズキッ", "zh": "…………刺痛感", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0be672ae7f397385b9790432002c16f632da167392abebdff4616056712279a4", "ja": "……うっ、イタッ！？　まだちょっとだけ痛むな。\nけどまあ、心配ないぞ、うん。", "zh": "……唔，好痛！？还是有点疼啊。\n不过嘛，用不着担心的，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "a755d0726cd13558aec4707f0d54c958c6abbb6350b3571f313ee9a2418bed2e", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？　なぜそうやって、\nすぐ調子に乗るんですか～？　うふふふふ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？　为什么您总是这样，\n一转眼就得意忘形了呢～？　呵呵呵呵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8c0dd6fe2ecf3ae28af6a6a5747fafddd1212e020a2c464b7809da6448561d7b", "ja": "うわっ！？　プレッシャーが……！", "zh": "哇！？这压力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8bc2ea9bbe4adf87d1dda7b5de5da434a137f23105de8e2d4050c4266e3c77d", "ja": "うふふふふ……。\nこの……ダメプロデューサー。", "zh": "呵呵呵呵……  \n你这个没用的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "05197adc86b299f3c43f07c22976c445a3e6eb53189bf249a8d4efdbe349912b", "ja": "と、朋花、{$P$}に圧掛けるのは\nそのくらいにしてさ。パーッと、打ち上げ行こうよ！", "zh": "朋、朋花，给{$P$}施压就到此为止吧。我们痛痛快快去参加庆功宴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "acca399ca182bfe5c46a55a7d1717661e2ca110fc92e1fff3eff9183e025ffa7", "ja": "私たち、先に着替えに行ってるね。\n{$P$}、ではまた後で。", "zh": "我们先去换衣服了。\n{$P$}，待会儿见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3e49f264222b7bfc117387db9d1f4dd545d741b58302d9df77f3ba8ca4752e51", "ja": "あ、ああ、わかった。ちゃんと汗拭くんだぞ！\n……あれ？　朋花。みんなと一緒に行かないのか？", "zh": "啊、啊啊，知道了。要好好把汗擦干啊！\n……咦？朋花，你不和大家一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "77e44d6878aef87dcd7bb08c31d4fa0aa262f2f384cf849172f93449126df937", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}さんに、\n言い忘れていた事を思い出しましたので～。", "zh": "是的。我想起了还有件事忘了对{$P$}先生说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f77eafcbcc68773b7823dc6c5e118acfe78f146da1343305392a7a61a9b9349e", "ja": "えっ、まだ言いたい事が……？\nいや、わかった。よし……どんとこい！", "zh": "诶，还有想说的话……？\n没事，我明白了。好……尽管说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "db81f0cf3ca04e4d3eec535a0c9551796a0fe22f9238f7e7566ed0ad71daf92f", "ja": "今回の公演、{$P$}さんにも、\nお世話になりました。お礼を言っておきますね～。", "zh": "这次的公演也多亏了{$P$}先生的关照。先向您道声谢啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1025_p", "source_sha256": "037253f988f0ec830ed6167c29f882247d83b0d2acad4865e44a3be93292517f", "ja": "……。\n……え？　それだけ？", "zh": "……。\n……诶？就这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "2bc537f984821794b39448aa760111e2aa930bc9a847568ac5022bb7e25f1836", "ja": "うふふ。他にも色々、言いたいことはありますが……。\n今回は、公演の成功に免じて、許してあげましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵。虽然还有很多别的话想说就是了……\n这次就看在演出成功的分上，原谅你吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e5616a8e674ce69c355b60db9f0d9791975949c48238c4588e023f03b227c58f", "ja": "そうか……うん、ありがとう。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "f5904007d1bb28e08fdc3b428b593cf926b15cca99c55cc18a8a4bf6440314a7", "ja": "まあ、私が何と言って止めても……あなたはどうせ、\n私たちのために、頑張ってしまうのでしょうし。", "zh": "哎，反正不管我说什么来阻止您……\n您终究还是会为了我们而努力勉强自己的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "a54926fe9827d17d782b952561cb80f6381f3fcaa946dcba2f6206e98450b400", "ja": "ですが……誓いの言葉は、忘れないでくださいね～？\nこの聖母に、全てを捧げたことを。", "zh": "但是……请不要忘记誓言哦～？\n你已经将一切都献给了这位圣母。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_090_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "b5d1da8a334f53eaa3ca5f4327d6babb33c92c87d1d054c240cfb2697c29a951", "ja": "もし、忘れたりしたら……。\nお仕置き、ですからね～？　うふふ♪", "zh": "要是忘了的话……就要接受惩罚哦～？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
